1
00:00:00,357 --> 00:00:03,927
So, look, I-I wasn't going
to say anything,

2
00:00:03,927 --> 00:00:06,557
(Amy:)but since you seem to be okay
with the article being canceled,

3
00:00:06,563 --> 00:00:07,593
(Amy:)I have a little confession.

4
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:10,065
(Amy:)I'm the reason it was pulled.

5
00:00:10,066 --> 00:00:11,936
(Bernadette:)What? How?

6
00:00:11,935 --> 00:00:14,105
(Amy:)I sent the editors
of the magazine

7
00:00:14,104 --> 00:00:15,734
(Amy:)a pretty scathing e-mail.

8
00:00:15,739 --> 00:00:17,539
(Bernadette:)Amy, what did you say?

9
00:00:17,541 --> 00:00:19,411
(Amy:)I simply pointed out

10
00:00:19,409 --> 00:00:21,109
(Amy:)that they would never consider
doing an article

11
00:00:21,111 --> 00:00:23,481
(Amy:)ranking male scientists
on their sexuality,

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,410
(Amy:)let alone showing them
in various stages of undress.

13
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:28,486
(Bernadette:)Because no one wants to see
Neil deGrasse Tyson

14
00:00:28,485 --> 00:00:31,885
(Bernadette:)in a wet T-shirt,
bent over the hood of a Porsche.

15
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:35,254
(Amy:)Well, it doesn't
make a difference,

16
00:00:35,258 --> 00:00:37,488
(Amy:)because they agreed it was
in bad taste,

17
00:00:37,494 --> 00:00:40,224
(Amy:)and now you agree, so...

18
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:42,500
(Amy:)Amy saves the day.

19
00:00:42,499 --> 00:00:45,399
(Bernadette:)No, what happened was
you got jealous,

20
00:00:45,402 --> 00:00:47,732
(Bernadette:)so you took away a chance
for me to get some publicity.

21
00:00:47,737 --> 00:00:49,607
(Amy:)But it was bad publicity.

22
00:00:49,606 --> 00:00:51,736
(Bernadette:)That's for me to decide,
not you.

23
00:00:51,741 --> 00:00:53,671
(Amy:)I disagree.

24
00:00:53,677 --> 00:00:57,477
(Amy:)As a female scientist, I think
what you do affects all of us.

25
00:00:57,481 --> 00:00:58,981
(Bernadette:)And I think
you don't like people

26
00:00:58,982 --> 00:01:00,112
(Bernadette:)expressing their sexuality

